ed it\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"There are three units on this floor.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"there are three units on this floor\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Two of the three units on this floor alarm at the same set point.\",\n      \"line\": 6,\n      \"span\": \"two of them alarm at the\\nsame set point\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Ice on the door seal holds the door open by a few millimetres.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"Ice on the seal holds the door open by a few\\nmillimetres\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Ice on the door seal is the usual cause of a slow rise.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"is the usual cause of a slow rise\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"You must call the on-call technician if the temperature is still rising 20 minutes after you arrive.\",\n      \"line\": 16,\n      \"span\": \"Call the on-call technician if the temperature is still rising 20 minutes after\\nyou arrive\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"When calling the on-call technician you must give the unit name.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"Give the unit name, the reading you took on arrival and the reading\\nnow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"When calling the on-call technician you must give the reading you took on arrival.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"Give the unit name, the reading you took on arrival and the reading\\nnow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"When calling the on-call technician you must give the reading now.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"Give the unit name, the reading you took on arrival and the reading\\nnow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong.\",\n      \"line\": 22,\n      \"span\": \"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"An alarm with no line in the log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended.\",\n      \"line\": 22,\n      \"span\": \"An\\nalarm with no line in the log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday until 08:00 on Monday.\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"span\": \"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday\\nuntil 08:00 on Monday\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":9286,"type":"result","duration_ms":9319,"uuid":"85ce93cf-44f5-45f3-8888-9c52130dfd0a","ttft_stream_ms":2833,"time_to_request_ms":901,"first_content_frame_ms":2833,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
